- ### Identifiers
+ ### Identificatori

- The identifying numbers of finance are checked here too. An
- [ISIN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Securities_Identification_Number) is the
- international identifier of a security. The `isin"…"` [interpolator] validates one at
- [compiletime], including its checksum, and `Isin(…)` does the same at runtime:
+ Anche i numeri identificativi della finanza vengono verificati qui. Un
+ [ISIN](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Securities_Identification_Number) è
+ l'identificatore internazionale di un titolo. L'[interpolatore] `isin"…"` ne convalida uno in
+ [tempo di compilazione], compresa la cifra di controllo, e `Isin(…)` fa lo stesso a runtime:

= [compiletime], including its checksum, and `Isin(…)` does the same at runtime:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"
+ val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"

= val security = isin"GB00BH4HKS39"
- ```
+ ```

